      ],
      "source": "https://roadsidethoughts.com/az/hotevilla-bacavi-xx-navajo-profile.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1906, a group of Hopi residents expelled from Oraibi founded Hotevilla, known as the 'hostiles'.",
